<Item XName="Text" Type="Param">
<DataEntry>The simulation in SystemVue is using the models in the gray boxes . When run from MATLAB, SVE will use the Baseband_Link model in the light blue box and the models in the gray box.&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;The state of the models, active or inactive (open) is controlled by the RunFromMATLAB parameter (see Parameters tab). You DO NOT have to manually update this parameter (other than to check that the right models are enabled/disabled). The SVE client API allows you to set it from MATLAB before the simulation is run, so leave this variable set to 0.</DataEntry>
<TextParam><T>Bool</T><D>1</D></TextParam></Item></Item>
