<Item XName="Note" UserName="Note" Type="Notes">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>&lt;P class=MsoTitle style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.75pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1pt; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;3GPP&lt;!--__SearchResult__0--&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt; NR DownLink Example of &lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;SVE&amp;nbsp;Baseband Link &lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;Keysight Technologies SystemVue Example&amp;nbsp;Workspace&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = &quot;o&quot; ns = &quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;Make sure you add the folder &amp;lt;SystemVue&amp;nbsp;Installation Dir&amp;gt;\Baseband_Link&amp;nbsp;to your MATLAB search path.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;Copy this workspace and the two MATLAB scripts (&lt;/SPAN&gt;NR_DL_Tx.m, &lt;/SPAN&gt;NR_DL_Tx_Functions.m) located in the same folder as this workspace to a directory where you have write access to.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;OL&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;Open each design and read the note inside the yellow box at the top to understand how it is setup to be simulated in both SystemVue and from MATLAB.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in&quot;&gt;For each&amp;nbsp;time MATLAB starts,&amp;nbsp;SystemVue Engine path&amp;nbsp;might need&amp;nbsp;to be specified by executing the command in MATLAB command window: &lt;EM&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;SystemVue.config.setEnginePath(&apos;&amp;lt;SystemVue Installation Dir&amp;gt;\Bin&apos;); &lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;where Bin contains the SystemVueEngine.exe.&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;Press the Run Analysis (green triangle) button and observe spectra, CCDF, ACLR and&amp;nbsp;the EVM results&amp;nbsp;in corresponding figures, tables and dataset in the design folder.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;Open the script &lt;/SPAN&gt;NR_DL_Tx.m in MATLAB and read the code and&amp;nbsp;comments to understand the flow.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;Run the script.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;Plots and results should appear showing spectra, CCDF, ACLR and EVM.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/OL&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoTitle style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.75pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1pt; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;This example workspace provides a SVE Baseband&amp;nbsp;Link&lt;!--__SearchResult__0--&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt; test bench demonstration to measure spectrum, constellation, EVM, ACLR and CCDF for&amp;nbsp;NR downlink.&lt;/FONT&gt; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;T&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;here are three designs located in three&amp;nbsp;folders.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;Folder:&amp;nbsp;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;DL_Tx&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;. This&amp;nbsp;NR_DL_Tx&amp;nbsp;design provides a NR downlink source&amp;nbsp;example to enable users to get NR DL source&amp;nbsp;data&amp;nbsp;generated by SystemVue in MATLAB through SVE Baseband&amp;nbsp;Link&lt;!--__SearchResult__1--&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;Folder: &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;DL_Rx&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;. This NR_DL_Rx design provides a NR downlink receiver&amp;nbsp;example. The design will receive NR DL&amp;nbsp;signal from MATLAB and&amp;nbsp;analyze&amp;nbsp;quality of&amp;nbsp;the received signal.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;Folder: &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;DL_TxRx&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;. This NR_DL_TxRx design includes both NR downlink source generation and signal reception&amp;nbsp;in SystemVue. Users can get NR DL source&amp;nbsp;data&amp;nbsp;generated by this SystemVue design in MATLAB and then perform&amp;nbsp;digital signal processing to the data in MATLAB. After that, the signal can be transferred back to SystemVue for further reception analysis.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;Overall the followings are the features supported in the example.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;NR transmitter signal generation according to Test Models defined in 3GPP&lt;!--__SearchResult__2--&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt; TS 38.141 V15.3.0 (2019-09)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;user defined downlink parameter configuration.&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-spacerun: yes&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;Spectrum, constellation, EVM, ACLR and CCDF measurements are available in MATALB after simulation.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;Test Models&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;Test Models of (0:NR-FR1-TM1.1; 1:NR-FR1-TM1.2; 2:NR-FR1-TM2; 3:NR-FR1-TM2a; 4:NR-FR1-TM3.1; 5:NR-FR1-TM3.1a; 6:NR-FR1-TM3.2; 7:NR-FR1-TM3.3; 8:NR-FR2-TM1.1; 9:NR-FR2-TM2; 10:NR-FR2-TM3.1) are&amp;nbsp;supported for &lt;STRONG&gt;FR1 FDD&lt;/STRONG&gt; / &lt;STRONG&gt;TDD&lt;/STRONG&gt; mode&amp;nbsp;and for &lt;STRONG&gt;FR2&lt;/STRONG&gt; &lt;STRONG&gt;TDD&lt;/STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;mode in this workspace.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;Set &lt;EM&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;UseTestModel&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt; to YES, then you can select &lt;EM&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;TestModel&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt; and &lt;EM&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Bandwidth&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt; to configure different test models.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;When &lt;EM&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;UseTestModel&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt; is set to YES, SSB is not enabled for test models. &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;When &lt;EM&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;UseTestModel&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt; is set to NO. NR signal is configured by other parameters. In this case, there is no SSB for Numerology 2 (60kHz) according to the specification. And SSB for 240kHz is not supported for now. When the &lt;EM&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Numerology&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt; is set 2 and 4, SSB should be disabled. BWP is defined occupy the whole bandwidth of component carrier. Frequency location of SSB in component carrier are defined by &lt;EM&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;SSB_RBOffset&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;.&amp;nbsp;It is defined with the reference to the beginning of component carrier. &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;SSB_RBOffset&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt; is defined based on 15kHz for Numerology 0 and Numerology1, and 60kHz for Numerology 3 as&amp;nbsp;defined in 3GPP&lt;!--__SearchResult__3--&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt; TS 38.211. &lt;EM&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;PDSCH_RBOffset&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt; and &lt;EM&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;PDSCH_NumRBs&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt; define the frequency location of PDSCH in BWP. PDSCH RB offset is defined with the reference to the beginning of BWP. Please make sure BWP and SSB is in the bandwidht and PDSCH is in the BWP. &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=3 face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;Either SSB or PDSCH can be disabled by setting &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;SSB_Enable&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt; or &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;PDSCH_Enable&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt; to NO when &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;UseTestModel&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt; is set to NO. But the workspace will not work if both of SSB and PDSCH are disabled. Please make sure at least one of them is enabled. Users need to specify&amp;nbsp;modulation for PDSCH by setting &lt;EM&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Modulation&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=3 face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt&quot;&gt;3GPP&lt;!--__SearchResult__4--&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt; NR EVM measurement&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;The EVM measurement in SystemVue is based on EVM model. In this example, one frame signal is used to do demodulation and get EVM&amp;nbsp;result.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;Filter is added in EVM model before demodulating the signal if&amp;nbsp;EnableRxFilter is set to YES.&amp;nbsp;Bandwidth of this filter is set as the same&amp;nbsp;bandwidth of the component carrier.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;There is also a Bandpass Filter before EVM measurement in both NR_DL_Rx and NR_DL_TxRx design.&amp;nbsp;The&amp;nbsp;filter will influence EVM measurement in&amp;nbsp;noise free scenario. But this&amp;nbsp;little influence can be neglected in noisy scenario.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt&quot;&gt;ACLR measurement&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;ACLR is calculate by function NR_ACLR_Measurement which is based on TS 38.104 (v15.3.0).&amp;nbsp;Basically,&amp;nbsp;ACLR of both first and second adjacent bandwidth&amp;nbsp;will be calculated automatically&amp;nbsp;once simulation is over. &lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;ACLR is valid for &lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB&gt;first adjacent bandwidth &lt;/SPAN&gt;when OversamplingOption is no less than 2 (Ratio 4) and ACLR is valid for first and second adjacent bandwidth when OversamplingOption is no less than&amp;nbsp;3 (Ratio 8).&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Notes&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;SignalPower&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt; is defined as the power of PDSCH. If SSB is in the location of PDSCH,&amp;nbsp;SignalPower equals to the power of the transmitter. If SSB is outside&amp;nbsp;PDSCH,&amp;nbsp;signal power of transmitter will be a little stronger than &lt;EM&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;SignalPower&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt; when &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;UseTestModel&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt; is set to No. When &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;UseTestModel&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt; is set to YES, number of RBs of PDSCH is obtained according to &lt;EM&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;TestModel&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;, &lt;EM&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Bandwidth&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt; and &lt;EM&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Numerology&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;.&amp;nbsp;PDCCH and PDSCH is not overlapped in time domain, the SignalPower&amp;nbsp;may not be&amp;nbsp;accurate when PDCCH is transmitted.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;Signal&amp;nbsp;distortions added in transmitter&amp;nbsp;modulator can be&amp;nbsp;set up by&amp;nbsp;parameters &lt;B&gt;GainImbalance&lt;/B&gt;, &lt;B&gt;PhaseImbalance&lt;/B&gt;, etc.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;Tx and Rx RF link can be turned on/off by parameter &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;EnableTxRFLink &lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;and&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt; EnableRxRFLink. &lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;In&amp;nbsp;Tx&amp;nbsp;RF link, a&amp;nbsp;RF power amplifier is included, where&amp;nbsp;amplier gain and noise figure can be set by parameter &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;TxRF_AmpGain &lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;TxRF_AmpNF&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;In&amp;nbsp;Rx&amp;nbsp;RF link, a&amp;nbsp;RF power amplifier and a frequency downconversion to Intermediate frequency&amp;nbsp;are included, where&amp;nbsp;power amplier gain and noise figure can be set by parameter &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;RxRF_LNAGain &lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;and&lt;EM&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt; RxRF_LNANF &lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;and output intermediate frequency frequency and&amp;nbsp;phase noise list of the oscillator can be set by parameter &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;RxRF_IFCarrier&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt; and &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;RxRF_IFOSFOPN&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Note &lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;Tx and Rx RF link only work for FR1. For FR2 simulation,they should remain to disabled.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;When OversamplingOption is more than 1 (Ratio 2), the signal will be down sampled to Ratio 2 with a bandpass filter and send to EVM model to&amp;nbsp;perform demodulation.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;Frequency range of source and EVM model&amp;nbsp;are defined by &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;FCarrier&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;The number of simulated subframes for EVM measurements should be no less than 15 and be multiples of 5 in this workspace for complete demodulation of EVM based on NR radio frame&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;The ideal low pass filter for spectrum shaping can be turned on/off by parameter &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;EnableTxFilter&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;. The filter&amp;nbsp;taps number&amp;nbsp;can be set by &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;FIR_Taps&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;. If &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;EnableTxFilter&lt;/EM&gt; &lt;/STRONG&gt;is set to NO, no spectrum shaping would be applied.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;This SVE&amp;nbsp;Baseband Link&lt;!--__SearchResult__2--&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;example is based on SystemVue 2020.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;Try to change the parameters, run the analysis and check the simulation results.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;UL type=disc&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;ACLR shows ACLR results when OversamplingOption is set to no less than Ratio 4&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=&quot;Arial Baltic&quot;&gt;Graph &lt;B&gt;&lt;I&gt;CCDF&lt;/I&gt;&lt;/B&gt; shows the Complementary Cumulative Distribution Function of the transmitted or received signals&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;Graph &lt;B&gt;&lt;I&gt;Constellation&lt;/I&gt;&lt;/B&gt; shows the constellation of each physical channel and signal when &lt;EM&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;SaveConstellation&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt; is set to YES. The constellation of PDSCH, PBCH, PSS and SSS are shown&amp;nbsp;when &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;UseTestModel&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt; is set to NO. PDSCH DMRS is shown&amp;nbsp;alongside&amp;nbsp;PDSCH channel and PBCH DMRS is shown&amp;nbsp;in PBCH. Constellation of PDSCH and PDCCH are shown when &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;UseTestModel&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt; is set to YES&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;Table &lt;EM&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Error Summary&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt; shows average EVM, peak EVM, frequency errors and other measured results of each frame from EVM model&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;Table &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;Error&amp;nbsp;&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;lists EVM of each enabled physical channel&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;Graph &lt;EM&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Spectrum&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/EM&gt; shows the spectrum of&amp;nbsp;NR downlink signal&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;All the&amp;nbsp;measurement results and plot figures contain the impact&lt;/FONT&gt; &lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;of Tx_RFLink and Rx_RFLink if they are enabled&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;</Text>
